Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.60,青空标,,0,0,0,,第三集：“大”运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.60,青空注,,0,0,0,,AozoraSubs | 青空字幕组\N校对：汐琥\N字幕样式：NixieSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:12.87,青空英,,0,0,0,,It's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:12.87,青空中,,0,0,0,,开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.82,0:00:16.90,青空英,,0,0,0,,It's my moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.82,0:00:16.90,青空中,,0,0,0,,这是我的时刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.34,青空英,,0,0,0,,Everybody stay calm, everybody stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.34,青空中,,0,0,0,,大家冷静，大家冷静。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:25.27,青空英,,0,0,0,,Alex received an email today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:25.27,青空中,,0,0,0,,Alex 今天收到了一封邮件。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.27,0:00:29.57,青空英,,0,0,0,,It's actually the same email that we receive every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.27,0:00:29.57,青空中,,0,0,0,,其实这封邮件我们每年都会收到。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.57,0:00:32.52,青空英,,0,0,0,,We will be delivering the major trophy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.57,0:00:32.52,青空中,,0,0,0,,我们要去运送 Major 奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:35.98,青空英,,0,0,0,,and we're literally just dropping off a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:35.98,青空中,,0,0,0,,说白了，我们只是去送一个箱子而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:38.52,青空英,,0,0,0,,Today is the day, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:38.52,青空中,,0,0,0,,今天就是那一天，各位。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.52,0:00:41.72,青空英,,0,0,0,,We, the DHL eSports Logistics Division
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.52,0:00:41.72,青空中,,0,0,0,,我们，DHL 电竞物流部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:44.42,青空英,,0,0,0,,have been tasked by head office to deliver
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:44.42,青空中,,0,0,0,,受总部委派，要送达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:46.42,青空英,,0,0,0,,this year's major trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:46.42,青空中,,0,0,0,,今年的 Major 奖杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:53.33,青空英,,0,0,0,,This is the big leagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:53.33,青空中,,0,0,0,,这才是大场面。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:55.32,青空英,,0,0,0,,This is the big deal, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:55.32,青空中,,0,0,0,,这才是真正的大事，各位。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:57.04,青空英,,0,0,0,,This is our World Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:57.04,青空中,,0,0,0,,这是我们的世界杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:58.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,This is our Super Bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:58.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,这是我们的超级碗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:00:59.92,青空英,,0,0,0,,This is eSports Logistics Oscars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:00:59.92,青空中,,0,0,0,,这就是电竞物流界的奥斯卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:00.92,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:00.92,青空中,,0,0,0,,没错，就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:02.77,青空英,,0,0,0,,That's the one, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:02.77,青空中,,0,0,0,,就是它，宝贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:05.17,青空英,,0,0,0,,We're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:05.17,青空中,,0,0,0,,我们回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.95,青空英,,0,0,0,,And yeah, I heard what they said about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.95,青空中,,0,0,0,,是啊，他们怎么说我们，我都听到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:14.19,青空英,,0,0,0,,I heard the rumours that we're stuck in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:14.19,青空中,,0,0,0,,我听到那些传言，说我们停滞不前。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.19,0:01:15.25,青空英,,0,0,0,,But guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.19,0:01:15.25,青空中,,0,0,0,,但你猜怎么着？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.25,0:01:17.21,青空英,,0,0,0,,So was 1.6
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.25,0:01:17.21,青空中,,0,0,0,,1.6 当年也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.21,0:01:21.22,青空英,,0,0,0,,and that was a billion-dollar franchise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.21,0:01:21.22,青空中,,0,0,0,,而那可是个价值十亿美元的招牌系列。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:21.30,青空英,,0,0,0,,This is our moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:21.30,青空中,,0,0,0,,这是属于我们的时刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.30,0:01:25.03,青空英,,0,0,0,,This is our moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.30,0:01:25.03,青空中,,0,0,0,,这是属于我们的时刻。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.03,0:01:28.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,And we are going to crush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.03,0:01:28.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,我们一定会把它拿下。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:12.76,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:12.76,青空中,,0,0,0,,呃。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:22.06,青空英,,0,0,0,,He's got a scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:22.06,青空中,,0,0,0,,他嗅到味儿了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:27.95,青空英,,0,0,0,,Bird of Prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:27.95,青空中,,0,0,0,,猛禽。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:43.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,Machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:43.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,机气。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:48.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,Did you just rip open your work shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:48.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,你刚把工作衬衫撕开了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:49.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:49.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,先生们。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:50.89,青空英,,0,0,0,,Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:50.89,青空中,,0,0,0,,女士。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:52.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,Today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:52.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,今天。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:56.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,Today, we make history.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:56.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,今天，我们要创造历史。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,This package.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,这个包裹。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:04.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,It's no normal package. This is no mere package.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:04.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,这可不是普通包裹。这绝不是普普通通的包裹。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:07.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,This package is the major trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:07.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,这个包裹，就是 Major 奖杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,Kissed by champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,被冠军亲吻过。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:15.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,Hoisted by legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:15.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,被传奇高高举起。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:19.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,And now, it is in our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:19.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,而现在，它在我们手上。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:27.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,He's been practicing his trophy lift in the bathroom mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:27.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,他一直在浴室镜子前练习举奖杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:28.99,青空英,,0,0,0,,All morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:28.99,青空中,,0,0,0,,练了一上午。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:40.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,Many moons ago, I almost went pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:40.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,很多年前，我差点就打上职业了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:45.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,But fate, dodgy internet connection, and poor teammates stood in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:45.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,但命运、糟糕的网络和坑爹的队友拦住了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,I was this close to the big leagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,我离大舞台就差那么一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:51.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,Wait, so you didn't actually go pro?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:51.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,等等，所以你其实没打过职业？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:54.42,青空英,,0,0,0,,Listen, Harry, things were different back in my day, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:54.42,青空中,,0,0,0,,听着，Harry，我那个年代情况不一样，懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:57.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have lasted five minutes in an I-Series red room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:57.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,换你去打 I-Series 的红房，你撑不过五分钟。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:03:59.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,Boat race champion over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:03:59.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,我们这儿可是有位赛艇冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,Packing my PC.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,把电脑装箱。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:01.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,Back of the boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:01.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,塞进后备箱。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:02.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,I'm in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:02.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,我坐进车里。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:03.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,I'm driving down to Telford.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:03.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,一路开到特尔福德。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:07.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,I slept on floors just for a chance to compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:07.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,为了能参赛，我睡过地板。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,行吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:12.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,We have two delivery sites.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:12.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,我们有两个送货点。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:13.66,青空英,,0,0,0,,No, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:13.66,青空中,,0,0,0,,不，我们没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:17.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,So mid control is really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:17.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,所以控制中路非常重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:20.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,You're going to want to make sure you have this in order to avoid any hostile encounters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:20.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,你得确保拿下这里，才能避免遭遇敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,A hostile encounter is just traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,所谓“遭遇敌人”，其实就是堵车。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:23.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:23.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:25.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,And that's why we need a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:25.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,所以我们才需要计划。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:26.76,青空英,,0,0,0,,And so, I have assigned you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:26.76,青空中,,0,0,0,,那么，我已经给你们每个人都分配了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:27.91,青空英,,0,0,0,,Roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:27.91,青空中,,0,0,0,,角色。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:29.53,青空英,,0,0,0,,Hugo Byron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:29.53,青空中,,0,0,0,,Hugo Byron。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:31.02,青空英,,0,0,0,,Entry fragger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:31.02,青空中,,0,0,0,,突破手。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:31.38,青空英,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:31.38,青空中,,0,0,0,,就是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:32.68,青空英,,0,0,0,,Give it up for Hugo, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:32.68,青空中,,0,0,0,,大家为 Hugo 鼓掌。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:34.05,青空英,,0,0,0,,Do you guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:34.05,青空中,,0,0,0,,大伙们。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.35,0:04:36.18,青空英,,0,0,0,,Always in the new guy at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.35,0:04:36.18,青空中,,0,0,0,,总是先让新人打头阵。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.23,0:04:39.97,青空英,,0,0,0,,Up next, of course, we've got Freya Spiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.23,0:04:39.97,青空中,,0,0,0,,接下来，当然，就是我们的 Freya Spiers。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:43.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,She's always such a supportive presence in the office, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:43.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,她在办公室里总是那么乐于支持大家，你不觉得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.16,0:04:45.01,青空英,,0,0,0,,Of course, we've also got Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.16,0:04:45.01,青空中,,0,0,0,,当然，我们还有 Harry。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.01,青空英,,0,0,0,,Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.01,青空中,,0,0,0,,教练。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:46.57,青空英,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:46.57,青空中,,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:47.57,青空英,,0,0,0,,Warm up the hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:47.57,青空中,,0,0,0,,把手热起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:48.57,青空英,,0,0,0,,Oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:48.57,青空中,,0,0,0,,天哪。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:50.21,青空英,,0,0,0,,Who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:50.21,青空中,,0,0,0,,还有谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:50.69,青空英,,0,0,0,,We've got Chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:50.69,青空中,,0,0,0,,我们有 Chase。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:52.10,青空英,,0,0,0,,Lurker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:52.10,青空中,,0,0,0,,自由人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:53.72,青空英,,0,0,0,,That's nice for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:53.72,青空中,,0,0,0,,这对你来说挺好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:55.24,青空英,,0,0,0,,You see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:55.24,青空中,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:56.24,青空英,,0,0,0,,I'm always the lurker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:56.24,青空中,,0,0,0,,我总是当自由人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:58.47,青空英,,0,0,0,,It's because he doesn't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:58.47,青空中,,0,0,0,,因为他信不过我。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:01.95,青空英,,0,0,0,,Co-figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:01.95,青空中,,0,0,0,,副指挥。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:05.42,青空英,,0,0,0,,And that just leaves, of course, Chad 'SPUNJ' Burchill,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:05.42,青空中,,0,0,0,,而最后剩下的，当然，就是 Chad 'SPUNJ' Burchill，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:06.38,青空英,,0,0,0,,AWPer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:06.38,青空中,,0,0,0,,狙击手。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:08.72,青空英,,0,0,0,,I won't let you down, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:08.72,青空中,,0,0,0,,我不会让您失望的，长官。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.97,0:05:10.37,青空英,,0,0,0,,I know you won't, my little star.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.97,0:05:10.37,青空中,,0,0,0,,我知道你不会，我的小星星。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:14.97,青空英,,0,0,0,,And I will be the CEO, strategist, and all-round mastermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:14.97,青空中,,0,0,0,,而我将担任 CEO、战略家，以及全能的总策划。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.61,0:05:16.02,青空英,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.61,0:05:16.02,青空中,,0,0,0,,好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:16.81,青空英,,0,0,0,,Let's run the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:16.81,青空中,,0,0,0,,我们来演练一遍。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:17.26,青空英,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:17.26,青空中,,0,0,0,,快点。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.26,青空英,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.26,青空中,,0,0,0,,你们还在等什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:18.79,青空英,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:18.79,青空中,,0,0,0,,快点。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:22.38,青空英,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:22.38,青空中,,0,0,0,,出发。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:31.00,青空英,,0,0,0,,IT infrastructure to warehouse operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:31.00,青空中,,0,0,0,,IT 基建部呼叫仓库运营部。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:32.00,青空英,,0,0,0,,Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:32.00,青空中,,0,0,0,,收到。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:34.96,青空英,,0,0,0,,No enemies over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:34.96,青空中,,0,0,0,,这边没有敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:37.40,青空英,,0,0,0,,It looks like the coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:37.40,青空中,,0,0,0,,看来一路通畅。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:38.90,青空英,,0,0,0,,Then you're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:38.90,青空中,,0,0,0,,那你就可以行动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:46.24,青空英,,0,0,0,,Trophy secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:46.24,青空中,,0,0,0,,奖杯已到手。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:49.75,青空英,,0,0,0,,Nothing about this is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:49.75,青空中,,0,0,0,,这一切都不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.32,青空英,,0,0,0,,I tried to take my lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.32,青空中,,0,0,0,,我想趁午休吃个饭。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:56.57,青空英,,0,0,0,,Alex said I was AFK, then he benched me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:56.57,青空中,,0,0,0,,Alex 说我挂机，然后就把我换下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:02.24,青空英,,0,0,0,,Sup?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:02.24,青空中,,0,0,0,,嘿？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:02.72,青空英,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:02.72,青空中,,0,0,0,,你好。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.52,青空英,,0,0,0,,I'm here for a delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.52,青空中,,0,0,0,,我是来取件的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.52,0:06:06.22,青空英,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, it should be just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.52,0:06:06.22,青空中,,0,0,0,,哦对，应该就是这儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:11.24,青空英,,0,0,0,,Guys, guys, where's the trophy gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:11.24,青空中,,0,0,0,,兄弟们，兄弟们，奖杯去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:12.43,青空英,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:12.43,青空中,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:16.22,青空英,,0,0,0,,My trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:16.22,青空中,,0,0,0,,我的奖杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:18.59,青空英,,0,0,0,,You serious? The trophy's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:18.59,青空中,,0,0,0,,你说真的？奖杯不见了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:19.89,青空英,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the trophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:19.89,青空中,,0,0,0,,你看到奖杯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.32,青空英,,0,0,0,,My trophy, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.32,青空中,,0,0,0,,我的奖杯，什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:35.42,青空英,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:35.42,青空中,,0,0,0,,它在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:39.64,青空英,,0,0,0,,Trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:39.64,青空中,,0,0,0,,奖杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:41.84,青空英,,0,0,0,,Freya, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:41.84,青空中,,0,0,0,,Freya，你……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:45.76,青空英,,0,0,0,,I didn't see it last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:45.76,青空中,,0,0,0,,我不是最后一个看到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:46.60,青空英,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:46.60,青空中,,0,0,0,,我没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:48.51,青空英,,0,0,0,,My trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:48.51,青空中,,0,0,0,,我的奖杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:53.92,青空英,,0,0,0,,I knew this day would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:53.92,青空中,,0,0,0,,我就知道这一天会来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:55.00,青空英,,0,0,0,,My trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:55.00,青空中,,0,0,0,,我的奖杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:56.84,青空英,,0,0,0,,Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:56.84,青空中,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:06:59.60,青空英,,0,0,0,,- Alex lost the trophy again. - Have you seen the trophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:06:59.60,青空中,,0,0,0,,- Alex 又把奖杯弄丢了。 - 你看到奖杯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:04.14,青空英,,0,0,0,,Did not see that one coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:04.14,青空中,,0,0,0,,这我可真没料到。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:05.69,青空英,,0,0,0,,My trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:05.69,青空中,,0,0,0,,我的奖杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.07,青空英,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the trophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.07,青空中,,0,0,0,,你看到奖杯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:07.69,青空英,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:07.69,青空中,,0,0,0,,拜托。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:10.49,青空英,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the trophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:10.49,青空中,,0,0,0,,你看到奖杯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:11.31,青空英,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:11.31,青空中,,0,0,0,,哇。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:17.70,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:17.70,青空中,,0,0,0,,是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:18.16,青空英,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:18.16,青空中,,0,0,0,,听我说。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.44,青空英,,0,0,0,,I had to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.44,青空中,,0,0,0,,我不得不把它拿走。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.93,0:07:28.47,青空英,,0,0,0,,I wanted to feel like a champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.93,0:07:28.47,青空中,,0,0,0,,我想体验一次当冠军的感觉，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.47,0:07:29.68,青空英,,0,0,0,,just for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.47,0:07:29.68,青空中,,0,0,0,,哪怕只有一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:37.29,青空英,,0,0,0,,The real trophy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:37.29,青空中,,0,0,0,,真正的奖杯，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:40.44,青空英,,0,0,0,,it isn‘t this beautiful chunk of handcrafted metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:40.44,青空中,,0,0,0,,不是这样一块精美的手工金属。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:43.79,青空英,,0,0,0,,The real trophy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:43.79,青空中,,0,0,0,,真正的奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:48.00,青空英,,0,0,0,,is the team you surround yourself with every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:48.00,青空中,,0,0,0,,是你每天围绕在身边的这支团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:50.20,青空英,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:50.20,青空中,,0,0,0,,是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.20,青空英,,0,0,0,,That's not how trophies work, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.20,青空中,,0,0,0,,奖杯可不是这么算的，小家伙。
